{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16934","headline":"秋日将赴江上杨弘微时任凤翔寄诗别 · 武元衡","name":"秋日将赴江上杨弘微时任凤翔寄诗别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞两相阻，悠悠南北心。\n燕惊沧海远，鸿避朔云深。\n夜梦江亭月，离忧陇树阴。\n兼秋无限思，惆怅属瑶琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}